# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository and check them out as LF on
# every platform, so Windows clients do not rewrite line endings to CRLF
# regardless of the system-level core.autocrlf setting.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Treat known binary assets as binary so Git never inspects or rewrites their
# bytes (line-ending normalization must never touch these).
*.woff2 binary
*.woff binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
